          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Large Number Fact"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.633,
            0.832,
            0.666
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In a single gram of healthy soil there can be 100 million to 1 billion bacteria and 1 lakh to 1 million fungi, which can support plants’ growth and health."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.681,
            0.846,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Share such large-number facts you know / come across with your class."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.719,
            0.494,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1.6 Did You Ever Wonder…?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.75,
            0.847,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Estu is amused by all these interesting facts about large numbers. While thinking about these, he came up with an unusual question, “Could the entire population of Mumbai fit into 1 lakh buses?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.806,
            0.378,
            0.825
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do you think?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.825,
            0.397,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How can we find out?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.842,
            0.847,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us assume a bus can accommodate 50 people. Then 1 lakh buses can accommodate 1 lakh × 50 = 50 lakh people."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 14,
